    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f98b3406",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: your_sense_of_humor_is_so_dark; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a close-up of chef Gordon Ramsay with an angry expression, seemingly confronting someone (whose back is turned). The overlaid text reads: 'your sense of humor is so dark, people are worried about you.' The intent is to mock or criticize someone's humor by implying it is disturbing or alarming enough to cause concern. While the meme does not target any specific protected group (race, gender, religion, etc.), it uses a confrontational and potentially intimidating tone to express disapproval. The 'harmful' classification applies because the message can be psychologically distressing or alienating to the recipient, potentially damaging their self-esteem or social standing by labeling their humor as 'dark' and 'worrying.' The visual of Ramsay's intense expression amplifies the perceived threat or negativity of the message, making it more likely to cause discomfort or harm to the person being targeted. The meme's overall intent is to ridicule and belittle the recipient's sense of humor through a combination of visual intimidation and verbal judgment.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_18b6345a"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
