      "instance_name": "confrontational_conversation",
      "label": "Confrontational Conversation",
      "description": "The scene depicts a confrontational interaction, a common social dynamic where one person is aggressively challenging or criticizing another. This is a real-world social phenomenon that is culturally understood. The meme uses this dynamic to convey a sense of threat or disapproval, which is heightened by Ramsay's expression and the text. The context of a 'confrontational conversation' is essential to understand the tone and intent of the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_18b6345a"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7d195f80",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "mockery",
      "label": "Mockery",
      "description": "Mockery is the act of making fun of someone or something in a scornful or contemptuous way. The meme's intent is to mock the recipient's sense of humor by labeling it as 'dark' and 'worrying'. This concept is central to understanding the meme's overall intent, which is to ridicule and belittle the recipient through verbal judgment and visual intimidation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
